{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2118327176928133517","post_url":"https://x.com/KimizqSmile/status/2118327176928133517","author":"@KimizqSmile","posted_at":"2026-11-05T12:58:50Z","collected_at":"2026-11-05T22:05:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-us","text":"📊 $OSCR  | Earnings Breakdown\nOscar Health beat expectations across the board.\n\n• EPS: $0.49 (vs. -$0.21 est.) • Revenue: $5.14B (vs. $4.72B est.)\n\nThe earnings surprise puts $OSCR on the radar. Next focus: guidance, margins, and post-earnings price action.","post_type":"original","in_reply_to_id":null,"thread_root_id":null,"quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":"Oscar Health (OSCR) chart: $37.11, +$2.78 (8.58%) yesterday closed at $35.19, +$1.92 (5.45%) pre-market live. 1D chart shown.","link_urls":[],"tickers_hint":["OSCR"],"engagement":{"likes":0,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"views":1}}
{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2118077529257037922","post_url":"https://x.com/KimizqSmile/status/2118077529257037922","author":"@KimizqSmile","posted_at":"2026-11-04T20:26:49Z","collected_at":"2026-11-05T22:05:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-us","text":"The era of massive Big Tech buybacks is over.\n\n$GOOGL $AMZN $MSFT $META $ORCL combined buybacks dropped to just $4.4B in Q3 2026 — the lowest since Q3 2017.\n\n-90% from the ~$45.9B peak in Q4 2021.\n\n3rd straight quarter below $5B.\n\n$GOOGL , $AMZN , $META  & $ORCL have bought back ZERO shares in 2026.\n\n(For context: these same companies did +$33B in Q1 2026.)\n\nAI capex is eating the buybacks.","post_type":"original","in_reply_to_id":null,"thread_root_id":null,"quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":"Infographic: Big Tech Buybacks Collapse from $45.9B peak to $4.4B. Companies: GOOGL, AMZN, MSFT, META, ORCL. Funding AI infrastructure instead.","link_urls":[],"tickers_hint":["GOOGL","AMZN","MSFT","META","ORCL"],"engagement":{"likes":0,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"views":21}}
